    "API Key 仅保存在本机 iOS 安全钥匙串（Keychain）中，直连目标接口，不经过任何第三方服务器。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your API key stays in this device's iOS Keychain and is sent only to the API you configure — never through a third-party server."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API Key 仅保存在本机 iOS 安全钥匙串（Keychain）中，直连目标接口，不经过任何第三方服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API Key 加密存储于 iOS 系统 Keychain，所有请求由手机直接发往你配置的 API 地址。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API keys are encrypted in the iOS Keychain, and every request goes straight from your device to the API you configured."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API Key 加密存储于 iOS 系统 Keychain，所有请求由手机直接发往你配置的 API 地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
