    "该地址使用 http:// 且指向公网：iOS 会阻止此类明文连接，API Key 与对话内容也会以明文传输。请改用 https:// 地址；局域网内的 http 服务（如 Ollama）不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This address uses http:// on the public internet: iOS blocks such unencrypted connections, and your API key and messages would travel in plain text. Use an https:// address instead; http services on your local network (such as Ollama) still work."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该地址使用 http:// 且指向公网：iOS 会阻止此类明文连接，API Key 与对话内容也会以明文传输。请改用 https:// 地址；局域网内的 http 服务（如 Ollama）不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
